<div class="two-col">
<article class="content-panel prose">
<h2>Education should be a little easier to access.</h2>
<p>I’m a student too, so I know how frustrating it can be to look for decent study material and find everything scattered everywhere.</p>
<p>I started D.El.Ed Buddy simply because I wanted to put useful things in one place — notes, visuals, previous papers, resources, and whatever else might make studying a little easier.</p>
<p>A lot of time goes into this behind the scenes. Finding and preparing materials, making things properly, building the site, fixing things when they break, and keeping everything organised.</p>
<p>And for now, I’m covering the costs myself — hosting, tools, and everything else that comes along with running it.</p>
<p>I’m just trying to keep it accessible for as many students as I can, for as long as I can manage.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="/materials/">→ Explore study materials</a>
</article>
